flowchart TD
    Start([Alert Arrives]) --> ClassAgent[Classification Agent]

    ClassAgent --> |Categorize| Decision{Alert Category}

    Decision -->|application-errors| Cat1[application-errors]
    Decision -->|business-logic| Cat2[business-logic]
    Decision -->|deploy-release| Cat3[deploy-release]
    Decision -->|scheduled-jobs| Cat4[scheduled-jobs]
    Decision -->|data-integrity| Cat5[data-integrity]
    Decision -->|cloud-infrastructure| Cat6[cloud-infrastructure]
    Decision -->|sql-database| Cat7[sql-database]
    Decision -->|auth-security| Cat8[auth-security]
    Decision -->|performance| Cat9[performance]
    Decision -->|monitoring-meta| Cat10[monitoring-meta]
    Decision -->|pubsub-messaging| Cat11[pubsub-messaging]

    Cat1 --> Tier1
    Cat2 --> Tier1
    Cat3 --> Tier1
    Cat4 --> Tier1
    Cat5 --> Tier1
    Cat6 --> Tier1
    Cat7 --> Tier1
    Cat8 --> Tier1
    Cat9 --> Tier1
    Cat10 --> Tier1
    Cat11 --> Tier1

    subgraph Tier1[Tier 1 - Always Parallel 8 Agents]
        CloudRun[Cloud Run Health]
        GCPLog[GCP Logging]
        GCPMetrics[GCP Metrics]
        Datadog[Datadog Observability]
        Sentry[Sentry Error]
        DeployCorr[Deploy Correlation]
        Teams[Teams Context]
        KnownIssues[Known Issues]
    end

    Tier1 --> Synthesis[Synthesis Agent]

    Synthesis --> |Category-specific routing| Tier2Decision{Tier 2 Dispatch Logic}

    Tier2Decision -->|application-errors| AppErrorTier2{Root cause unclear?}
    AppErrorTier2 -->|Yes| CodebaseApp[Codebase Agent]
    AppErrorTier2 -->|No| SkipTier2App[Skip Tier 2]

    Tier2Decision -->|business-logic| CodebaseBiz[Codebase Agent]

    Tier2Decision -->|deploy-release| SkipTier2Deploy[Skip Tier 2]

    Tier2Decision -->|scheduled-jobs| JobsTier2{Job signals}
    JobsTier2 -->|Uses PubSub| PubSubJobs[Pub/Sub Agent]
    JobsTier2 -->|Touches DB| SQLJobs[SQL DBA Agent]
    JobsTier2 -->|Both| BothJobs[Pub/Sub + SQL DBA]
    JobsTier2 -->|Neither| SkipTier2Jobs[Skip Tier 2]

    Tier2Decision -->|data-integrity| DataTier2[SQL DBA + Codebase]

    Tier2Decision -->|cloud-infrastructure| InfraTier2{Infrastructure signals}
    InfraTier2 -->|Redis/Valkey| CacheInfra[Cache Agent]
    InfraTier2 -->|PubSub| PubSubInfra[Pub/Sub Agent]
    InfraTier2 -->|Both| BothInfra[Cache + Pub/Sub]
    InfraTier2 -->|Neither| SkipTier2Infra[Skip Tier 2]

    Tier2Decision -->|sql-database| SQLTier2[SQL DBA Mandatory]
    SQLTier2 --> SQLExtra{Query source needed?}
    SQLExtra -->|Yes| SQLCodebase[+ Codebase Agent]
    SQLExtra -->|No| SQLOnly[SQL DBA only]

    Tier2Decision -->|auth-security| AuthTier2[Auth/Security Agent Mandatory]

    Tier2Decision -->|performance| PerfTier2{Performance signals}
    PerfTier2 -->|DB signals| SQLPerf[SQL DBA Agent]
    PerfTier2 -->|Cache signals| CachePerf[Cache Agent]
    PerfTier2 -->|Both| BothPerf[SQL DBA + Cache]
    PerfTier2 -->|Neither| SkipTier2Perf[Skip Tier 2]

    Tier2Decision -->|monitoring-meta| SkipTier2Monitor[Skip Tier 2]

    Tier2Decision -->|pubsub-messaging| PubSubTier2[Pub/Sub Agent Mandatory]

    CodebaseApp --> FinalSynthesis
    SkipTier2App --> FinalSynthesis
    CodebaseBiz --> FinalSynthesis
    SkipTier2Deploy --> FinalSynthesis
    PubSubJobs --> FinalSynthesis
    SQLJobs --> FinalSynthesis
    BothJobs --> FinalSynthesis
    SkipTier2Jobs --> FinalSynthesis
    DataTier2 --> FinalSynthesis
    CacheInfra --> FinalSynthesis
    PubSubInfra --> FinalSynthesis
    BothInfra --> FinalSynthesis
    SkipTier2Infra --> FinalSynthesis
    SQLCodebase --> FinalSynthesis
    SQLOnly --> FinalSynthesis
    AuthTier2 --> FinalSynthesis
    SQLPerf --> FinalSynthesis
    CachePerf --> FinalSynthesis
    BothPerf --> FinalSynthesis
    SkipTier2Perf --> FinalSynthesis
    SkipTier2Monitor --> FinalSynthesis
    PubSubTier2 --> FinalSynthesis

    FinalSynthesis[Final Synthesis Agent] --> Report[Generate Report]
    Report --> TeamsPost[Post to Teams]
    TeamsPost --> End([Complete])

